;; Simon's dungeon under the 5-4 lift shaft (campaign only: riding 5-4's down lift on past the
;; screen bottom carries the player down here, the shaft's `descent` zone; level/campaign.ts).
;; One screen: the player drops in at the right; a single hard block (11,10) stands between the
;; landing and a Koopa pacing up to the CRACKED WALL (column 5, rows 8-10, `&`). Any hero attack
;; breaks the wall; a hero with no attack stomps the Koopa and kicks its shell into it (kicked the
;; wrong way, the shell bounces off the block and comes back to the wall). The Koopa comes back
;; if lost while the wall stands (`respawn`). Behind the wall, steps lead down to a hole: the
;; drop into Simon's crypt. The clock runs on (time: inherit).

[tiles]
;; 0
%%%%%%%%%%%....%
%%%%%%%%%%%....%
%%%%%%%%%%%....%
%%%%%%.........%
%%%%%%.........%
%%%%%%.........%
%%%%%%.........%
%%%%%%.........%
.....&.........%
.....&.........%
.....&.....B...%
....%%%%%%%%%%%%
...%%%%%%%%%%%%%
..%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
..%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

[entities]
;; Comes back while the cracked wall stands (objects/crypt.ts Respawner).
koopa-green 8 10 respawn=true
candle 7 8
candle 10 7

[zones]
;; Down the steps behind the wall and through the hole: Simon's crypt, dropping in from above.
pit 0 -> 5-4-crypt 1 0

[decor]
crypt:candelabra-0 9 10
